      ],
      "id": "holder",
      "lane_id": "author",
      "objective": "Produce a falsifiable implementation spec for RFC 0165 and GH #583 that prevents stale Claude lane OAuth copies before provider launch. Resolve hydration point, source and destination resolution, rotation-race handling, custody storage, provider_auth_gate=off behavior, recovery circuit breaker behavior, freshness lead time, operator remediation, redaction, and tests. This is the published claim the falsifiers will challenge.",
